@page "/terms"
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]
@attribute [Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization.AllowAnonymous]
@layout Layout.PublicLayout
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Options
@using Playbook.Application.Access
@inject IOptions<AccessOptions> Access

<PageTitle>Terms of Service — Playbook</PageTitle>

<section class="pub-section pub-narrow pub-legal">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="pub-fine">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>Playbook is a web application that analyzes publicly available NFL data and your fantasy football league
       to produce recommendations. By purchasing a license or using Playbook you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>License</h2>
    <p>Your one-time purchase gives one person a personal, non-transferable license to use Playbook for as long
       as the service is offered. You may use your license key on your own devices; you may not share, resell or
       publish it. We may deactivate keys that are shared or abused.</p>

    <h2>Information only</h2>
    <p>Recommendations, projections and market analysis are informational and based on imperfect data and models.
       They are not guarantees, and they are not gambling, betting, investment or professional advice. Playbook does
       not place wagers or take actions in your fantasy league. You are solely responsible for your decisions.</p>

    <h2>Third-party data</h2>
    <p>Playbook relies on third-party sources (for example Sleeper, ESPN, nflverse and sportsbook odds feeds). We don't
       control them and they may be unavailable, delayed or inaccurate. Playbook is not affiliated with or endorsed by
       the NFL, Sleeper or any fantasy platform.</p>

    <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>We work to keep Playbook running but provide it "as is" without warranty of uninterrupted or error-free
       operation. We may change or retire features. If we discontinue the service entirely we will give reasonable notice.</p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by law, our total liability for any claim relating to Playbook is limited to the amount
       you paid for your license, and we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses, including lost
       fantasy-league winnings or entry fees.</p>

    <h2>Payments and refunds</h2>
    <p>Payments are processed by Lemon Squeezy, our merchant of record. See the <a href="/refunds">refund policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>@if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Access.Value.SupportEmail)) { <a href="mailto:@Access.Value.SupportEmail">@Access.Value.SupportEmail</a> } else { <text>Use the contact option on your Lemon Squeezy receipt.</text> }</p>
</section>
